## Architecture Patterns

### File Structure

```
src/
├── app/                    # Next.js App Router
│   ├── (auth)/            # Public auth routes
│   ├── (dashboard)/       # Protected routes
│   └── api/               # API routes
├── components/
│   ├── atoms/             # Buttons, inputs, labels
│   ├── molecules/         # Form fields, cards
│   └── organisms/         # Forms, tables, modals
├── lib/                   # Utilities (db, auth, s3)
├── services/              # Business logic
├── schemas/               # Zod schemas
└── types/                 # TypeScript types
```

### Atomic Design

- **Atoms**: Basic UI elements (Button, Input, Label, Badge)
- **Molecules**: Composite components (FormField, Card, Alert)
- **Organisms**: Complex components (ExpenseForm, ExpenseTable, ApprovalModal)

